# Renders docs/media/swe-demo.gif — run from repo root: vhs docs/media/swe-demo.tape
Output docs/media/swe-demo.gif
Set FontSize 13
Set Width 1100
Set Height 640
Set TypingSpeed 40ms
Set Theme "Catppuccin Mocha"
Type "# OpenAgentOS: SWE agent fixes failing tests, human approves the merge"
Enter
Type "uv run python -m apps.swe.demo 2>/dev/null"
Enter
Sleep 45s
